'' WINDOWS READS THE DEFAULT MANIFEST: the program asks its own DPI awareness and is per-monitor
'' aware (2). Built by the same compiler without the manifest it was 0 (measured 2026-11-13).
'' HOSTS: windows
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/driver/src/manifest-dpi.bas -o tests/driver/manifestapplied.exe
